IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COLLECTION-ENTRY.
*> Premium collection calculates the remaining invoice amount after offsets.
*> It does not collect cash, change account balances, or save a ledger.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 COLLECTION-REQUEST.
   05 INVOICE-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
   05 ACCOUNT-BALANCE PIC 9(7)V99.
   05 REFUND-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
   05 REWARD-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
   05 BALANCE-ALLOWED PIC X.
   05 REFUND-READY PIC X.
   05 REWARD-ELIGIBLE PIC X.
   05 READ-STATUS PIC X(8).
   05 AMOUNT-DUE PIC 9(7)V99.
   05 COLLECTION-RESULT PIC X(12).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING COLLECTION-REQUEST.
MAIN.
    MOVE INVOICE-AMOUNT TO AMOUNT-DUE
    MOVE SPACES TO COLLECTION-RESULT
    EVALUATE READ-STATUS
      WHEN "READY"
        CALL "OFFSET-RULES" USING BY REFERENCE COLLECTION-REQUEST
        MOVE "CALCULATED" TO COLLECTION-RESULT
      WHEN "NOTFOUND"
        MOVE "REVIEW" TO COLLECTION-RESULT
      WHEN OTHER
        MOVE "RETRY" TO COLLECTION-RESULT
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.
